[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17941.83, "timestamp": "04:59:01", "text": "我不想见到任何我在乎的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17942.39, "timestamp": "04:59:02", "text": "居住在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17944.948, "timestamp": "04:59:04", "text": "那样的话，我担心的是某人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17946.708, "timestamp": "04:59:06", "text": "也。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17948.31, "timestamp": "04:59:08", "text": "如果发生任何搞砸的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17949.91, "timestamp": "04:59:09", "text": "或者如果人们开始问"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17952.39, "timestamp": "04:59:12", "text": "不管亨里克那边发生了什么事，那就是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17953.11, "timestamp": "04:59:13", "text": "不是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17955.43, "timestamp": "04:59:15", "text": "好的。我本来打算去拿那块水晶。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17958.07, "timestamp": "04:59:18", "text": "从坑里拿出来，然后像我想的那样使用它，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17959.99, "timestamp": "04:59:19", "text": "有人会接受这份工作。于是，我就离开了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17961.91, "timestamp": "04:59:21", "text": "我可以帮你弄点东西。你正在阅读"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17963.75, "timestamp": "04:59:23", "text": "身份。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17965.91, "timestamp": "04:59:25", "text": "除了你可以自由行动之外，还有许多人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17967.99, "timestamp": "04:59:27", "text": "愿意给你钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17970.55, "timestamp": "04:59:30", "text": "有些人冒着生命危险去获取……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17972.07, "timestamp": "04:59:32", "text": "客人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17973.35, "timestamp": "04:59:33", "text": "所以，你其实没有旅行计划。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17974.15, "timestamp": "04:59:34", "text": "需要许可证吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17977.75, "timestamp": "04:59:37", "text": "他这是在套取信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17979.43, "timestamp": "04:59:39", "text": "天哪，你说的是假的那个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17983.75, "timestamp": "04:59:43", "text": "这座城市里有些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17986.23, "timestamp": "04:59:46", "text": "没有旅行餐盘。那么，什么是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17988.47, "timestamp": "04:59:48", "text": "不，你可以拿走。你可以进行交易。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17989.83, "timestamp": "04:59:49", "text": "你不是本地人，所以他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17990.788, "timestamp": "04:59:50", "text": "可能不在他的考虑范围内"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17992.07, "timestamp": "04:59:52", "text": "交换一点窥探信息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17993.35, "timestamp": "04:59:53", "text": "听起来容易，但你应该……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17993.91, "timestamp": "04:59:53", "text": "小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17996.15, "timestamp": "04:59:56", "text": "午夜12点。好的。是否有时间"}]